  ($$forearm_mappings_v1$$, $$cat-139:forearm.fcr$$, $$cat-139$$, $$forearm.fcr$$, $$wrist.flexion$$, $$direct$$, $$dynamic$$, $$anatomy$$, $$individual$$, false, $$A wrist curl is built on wrist flexion, the flexor carpi radialis's main action; the wrist moves through range against the load.$$, $$reviewed$$, $$same$$),
