  ($$forearm_mappings_v1$$, $$cat-140:forearm.fds$$, $$cat-140$$, $$forearm.fds$$, $$fingers.pip_flexion$$, $$incidental$$, $$isometric$$, $$inference$$, $$shared$$, false, $$The fingers hold the bar or handle while the wrist moves: incidental grip, shared between FDS and FDP.$$, $$reviewed$$, $$same$$),
  ($$forearm_mappings_v1$$, $$cat-141:forearm.ecrb$$, $$cat-141$$, $$forearm.ecrb$$, $$wrist.extension$$, $$contributing$$, $$dynamic$$, $$anatomy$$, $$shared$$, false, $$Winding the roller moves each wrist through flexion and extension against the hanging weight, but which way it is wound (and so which group lifts and which lowers) is not recorded. Both groups are credited as contributing and shared, rather than as direct work for either.$$, $$reviewed$$, $$same$$),
