  ($$forearm_mappings_v1$$, $$cat-299:forearm.ecrb$$, $$cat-299$$, $$forearm.ecrb$$, $$wrist.extension$$, $$stabilizer$$, $$isometric$$, $$emg$$, $$individual$$, false, $$A heavy handle held at the side needs the wrist held straight while the fingers grip, and the wrist extensors work alongside a grip (M2): isometric stabilization, never dynamic credit (brief §4, farmer carry: wrist stabilization).$$, $$reviewed$$, $$same$$),
