  ($$forearm_mappings_v1$$, $$cat-299:forearm.fdp$$, $$cat-299$$, $$forearm.fdp$$, $$fingers.dip_flexion$$, $$direct$$, $$isometric$$, $$anatomy$$, $$shared$$, true, $$Holding on is the purpose of the set, so the finger flexors are the direct target, working isometrically for the time logged. FDS and FDP share the work; nothing in a whole-hand grip separates them (S3, S8). Straps would take the load off the fingers, so a strapped set earns no grip credit.$$, $$reviewed$$, $$same$$),
