  ($$forearm_mappings_v1$$, $$cat-401:forearm.fdp$$, $$cat-401$$, $$forearm.fdp$$, $$fingers.dip_flexion$$, $$direct$$, $$dynamic$$, $$anatomy$$, $$shared$$, false, $$The bar rolls to the fingertips and is curled back by bending the fingers, so the finger flexors move through range: direct, dynamic work, shared between FDS and FDP. A set where the fingers do not move is not this exercise.$$, $$reviewed$$, $$same$$),
