  ($$forearm_mappings_v1$$, $$cat-407:forearm.fds$$, $$cat-407$$, $$forearm.fds$$, $$fingers.pip_flexion$$, $$incidental$$, $$isometric$$, $$inference$$, $$shared$$, false, $$The fingers hold the handle while the wrist or forearm does the work: an incidental grip, shared between FDS and FDP.$$, $$reviewed$$, $$same$$),
